      "type": "p",
      "text": "The signs: brick faces missing in patches, flakes of brick on the roof and in the gutters, a chimney that looks much worse on the sunny south side (where the freeze-thaw cycles are most frequent), and paint or sealer peeling along with the brick. The joints may look fine."
