      "text": "A spalling chimney got covered in a coat of stucco to hide the damage. It traps every bit of water that gets in, and the brick keeps failing underneath while the stucco cracks and bulges. The correction depends on what's under it; often the stack above the roof is rebuilt, because the brick behind the stucco is gone."
