      "text": "A few Verona additions and newer homes vent a prefab fireplace through a sided wood box with a metal cover on top. Those fail at the cover, which rusts through in 5 to 8 years. We replace it with a pitched stainless cover and reframe the box if needed. It's a small share of our work in town next to the masonry above."
