      "text": "we grind out the worn or hard mortar three-quarters of an inch to an inch deep, carefully on soft brick so the edges aren't nicked, replace spalled units with reclaimed brick matched for color range as well as size, and repoint in a lime-rich Type N or Type O matched to the original color and sand, tooled to the original joint. Stone is raked by hand, loose stones reset, and repointed to the original profile."
