      "lead": "The repair:",
      "text": "we remove the old wash, replace a rusted pan with a stainless cover where the chimney is a veneered chase, rebuild the top courses if they've taken water, and form and pour a reinforced concrete crown — sloped away from every flue, overhanging the brick by two inches, with reinforcement on the wide tops and a bond break around each flue tile. Each flue gets a stainless cap."
